# Synthetic SAP demo tables for Krusgraph (fabric_backend/sap_demo.py, round n33). Every value is made up.
# Paste this whole cell into a notebook attached to the lakehouse (demo_lh) and run it. It writes sap_<name> tables
# (sap_t001, sap_kna1, sap_vbak, ...) as Delta tables in the default schema, replacing tables of those names.
